{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中石化冠德截至六月底止中期，按年少賺三成一。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">純利3.86億元，中期息每股派0.1元，與上一年度同期相同。期內收入增長近一成半，至3.53億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T00:37:57.272155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}